  <h2>What the surplus funds</h2>

  <div class="rd-surplus-allocation">
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>£25bn</strong>
        Green transition investment over 5 years — heat pumps, insulation, public transport, renewables planning
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>£10bn</strong>
        Economic contingency reserve — buffer for revenue shortfalls during the transition
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Remainder</strong>
        Additional public services (NHS, education) or debt reduction: from 98% to 85% of GDP over 10 years
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>

